WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
[calm electronic music]
82 to 1: machine identities for every human in the enterprise.

00:07.600 --> 00:14.200
Attackers don't break in. They log in.

00:15.300 --> 00:18.800
Every login looks valid.

00:19.000 --> 00:21.000
But valid isn't the same as safe.

00:21.200 --> 00:23.600
So we ask better questions: Is it really them? Is this key still theirs? Should it act?

00:23.800 --> 00:26.200
Verified. Every identity. Every time.

00:26.400 --> 00:33.000
Across every system you already run.

00:33.400 --> 00:37.200
One identity. Many doors.

00:37.400 --> 00:41.000
When one door is exposed, we see where the risk travels.

00:41.500 --> 00:45.200
Every identity, scored continuously.

00:45.600 --> 00:49.400
Every intent, verified before it acts.

00:49.800 --> 00:54.400
Detect: risk scored the moment behaviour changes.

00:54.800 --> 00:59.400
Decide: agents act only within their task.

00:59.800 --> 01:04.400
Prove: personal data, only with purpose and consent.

01:04.900 --> 01:09.600
Secure every identity. Verify every intent.

01:11.000 --> 01:20.000
Deep Algorithms. Identity security for people, machines and AI agents.
